      "problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -8\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix.",
